					"nextDialogs": [
						730150354
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730150354,
					"content": "嗚…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730150355
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭那庫拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 730150355,
					"content": "嘿嘿，原來是這樣啊。不過拿派蒙當藉口可不是好孩子！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730150356
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730150356,
					"content": "#既然這樣，{NICKNAME}，我們就和蘭那庫拉一起走安全的路吧，路上小心一點，不要驚動了蕈獸。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730150357
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730150357,
					"content": "那我可是經驗豐富。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730150358
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730150358,
					"content": "對喔，總覺得已經做過很多次類似的事情了…",
