					"content": "派蒙可以自己逃跑。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730150350
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730150350,
					"content": "#我才不會丟下{NICKNAME}自己逃跑呢！應該…不會吧？",
